acceptance_criteria: Six swarm commands pass real git and SDK integration tests; all release gates pass at four 100 percent coverage dimensions; no tracked host paths; maintainer reviews before publication.
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-15T18:29:27.225Z",codex-agent,"Companion specification: pm-cli-website-zlzh. Local package only; no publication or remote writes. Certified SDK corpus, conservative footprints, actual git merge simulation, private worktree locations. Supplied pm-lint lacks the sync caller; copied the identical pinned caller from supplied pm-jev reference."
  "2026-10-15T18:39:09.567Z",codex-agent,"Implemented command engines and SDK wiring. Regression suite uses real git and SDK trackers. SDK gaps: custom extension fields cannot be selected by get --fields, so full reads are used; claim_state must be requested explicitly. Settings private sections require SDK file/path read APIs, with governed mutateWorkspaceSettings for writes. Landing uses chained synthetic commits and tests merged snapshots before local merges."
  "2026-10-15T18:54:10.392Z",codex-agent,"Read-only dogfood on an isolated pm-vcs copy: 134 corpus items, 8 ready candidates, 4 planning waves, 14 separation pairs; 0 active lanes, 0 merge predictions, 0 conflicts. Suggested ids: pm-vcs-dispatch104, pm-vcs-j7mz, pm-vcs-w3yi, pm-vcs-00mb. Tracked state unchanged. Zero active lanes is zero-case conflict evidence."
  "2026-10-15T18:59:43.404Z",codex-agent,"Direct real-repository suite passed 63/63, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todo, with 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines across all 18 authored modules. Packed npm/npx and native Bun/bunx acceptance passed 1/1, including local execution and tracked-path privacy. Nested pm test snapshot context binds linked-test provenance to its outer workspace, so secondary fixture worktrees are refused as untrusted; the linked acceptance scope covers planner/start/status/sync/reap/settings, with landing covered by the direct complete suite. No trust policy is bypassed."
  "2026-10-15T19:02:38.128Z",codex-agent,"Final copied-repository planning reports 21 separated pairs: 14 footprint/dependency/unknown separations and 7 assignments to another safe wave. Counts remain 134 items, 8 ready candidates, 4 waves, zero active lanes/predictions/conflicts. All three behavioural revert controls failed on assertions as intended and were restored byte-for-byte. The development-only glob advisory is tracked separately; production audit is clean."
  "2026-10-15T19:04:39.016Z",codex-agent,"Scoped PM-linked acceptance passes 10/10 with zero failed/skipped/cancelled/todo, through one passing linked command. Verification details, exact negative controls, full-suite scope, isolated copied-repository counts, SDK limitations and the development advisory are in docs/verification.md. No hosted services, remote writes, agents or publication were used. The maintainer owns final review and item closure."
